nodecode-model-tiers
=====================

The code in this folder is MIT (see LICENSE).

Every sentence the cell quotes is from one of thirteen documents in one
archive:

  elder-plinius/CL4R1T4S
  https://github.com/elder-plinius/CL4R1T4S
  head 93a584765460c2fb0ad58380bba476f2149df138, 9 November 2026
  read 11 November 2026

The archive's size, line count and sha256 for each document are in DATA.LISP,
and every quote names its document and its line. The largest and most useful
of them is ANTHROPIC/CLAUDE-CODE-FABLE-5.2.txt: 957,315 bytes, 7,832 lines,
sha256 d54e74e3ffd318c3cd0df3ea71f3e54efdd862ee5d988c03206bff10834e3522.

The words in those documents are each vendor's own - Anthropic's, OpenAI's,
Z.ai's, Meta's, Cursor's, Cline's - leaked and published by elder-plinius under
CL4R1T4S's AGPL-3.0. The cell reproduces short quotations with their line
numbers, for commentary and reference, and does not redistribute the documents:
model_tiers_quote fetches one from the archive and caches it in the reader's own
home. If a quotation is a problem, the document key and the line number say
which one to point at.

The hierarchy, the notes and the answers are our reading of those documents;
where a document and a vendor page disagree, the cell gives the document's
reading of itself. Nothing here is a claim that any vendor published any of it.

No software of any model's is included.
